<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n22880" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γρῦ</span></b> , used with negs., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀποκρινομένῳ . . οὐδὲ γρῦ</span> not <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>a syllable</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Pl.</u>
				17
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				D.
				19.39
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μηδὲ γ. λέγε</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Men.
					521
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὄψου μηδὲν . . μηδὲ γ.</span>
			not <i>a morsel</i>, not <i>a bit</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Antiph.
				190.13
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διαφέρει Χαιρεφῶντος οὐδὲ γ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Men.
					364
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>Sam.</u>
				310
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Aristaenet.
				1.17
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Jul.
			</span></i><i>ad Ath.</i><i><span class="en">
				273b
			</span></i>. (Expld. of the noise of swine, not even <i>a grunt</i>,
			by Sch.<i><span class="en">
				Ar.
			</span></i> l.c.; also, <i>a small coin</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Suid.
			</span></i>; but prop., =
			<i>dirt under the nail</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>, who also explains it as 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γρύτη</span>
			, cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γρύξ</span>.)</div>
